          "before": "\"\"\"R515 complete original live128 components with a local physical mode cache.\n\nThe complete SIMD stage map and boundary mathematics are unchanged. The\nphysical endpoint and audit compiler use the explicit R515 source adapter.\nOnly finite radial-mode words are shared inside one physical_jets query;\nall original angular sums, C solves, rows, independent audit and gates remain.\nNo local science, complete derivative enclosure or speed promise is made.\n\"\"\"",
